# Every file in this repository is authored and read as LF. Force that on
# checkout and commit regardless of the checking-out machine's core.autocrlf
# setting, instead of relying on each contributor's local git config.
#
# Without this, a Windows client with autocrlf=true (the common default)
# warns "LF will be replaced by CRLF" on every `git add`, and a future
# `git checkout` of these paths would actually rewrite them to CRLF in the
# working tree. That would break the LF assumption the extraction tooling
# under tools/ relies on (every script writes files with `newline="\n"`
# explicitly) and would show as a spurious whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Anything genuinely binary should never be normalized or diffed as text,
# in case one of these is ever added later (none are tracked today).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.pdf binary
